WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.205
Week 6: The Present: Regular Actions. describe habits ask about routines say how often something happens

2
00:00:07.205 --> 00:00:29.057
Read for the situation. Raúl vive cerca de su trabajo. Camina a la oficina, come con sus compañeros y estudia inglés por la noche. Los fines de semana escribe a su familia. Raúl lives near his workplace. He walks to the office, eats with his coworkers, and studies English at night. On weekends he writes to his family.

3
00:00:29.057 --> 00:00:37.627
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:37.627 --> 00:00:42.997
Reading activities. Reading activity 13; Reading activity 14

5
00:00:42.997 --> 00:00:50.778
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:50.778 --> 00:01:15.905
Model language. Trabajo por la mañana y estudio por la noche. — I work in the morning and study at night. ¿Dónde vives? — Where do you live? Comemos juntos los viernes. — We eat together on Fridays. Ella escribe en su diario cada día. — She writes in her journal every day. A veces bebo café después de comer. — Sometimes I drink coffee after eating.

7
00:01:15.905 --> 00:01:25.654
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
